{"title":"Tales of the Moonlit Night","synopsis":"Ketika Segun Han, seorang remaja berusia 16 tahun yang bermimpi menjadi pembalap motor, pulang ke rumah suatu malam setelah baku tembak dengan para pengendara motor, ia menemukan bahwa orang tua dan kakak laki-lakinya telah dibunuh oleh vampir. Segun menjadi sangat marah dan mulai memburu vampir! Akankah ia menjadi vampir atau mati sebagai manusia? Pertempuran brutal antara vampir dan pemburu vampir terjadi di Seoul!","alternative_title":"Reveries of the Moonlight (2025), Chronicles of the Moonlit Night, Moonlight Chat, Moonlight Conversation, Moonlight Talk, Tales of the Moonlit Night, 월야환담 (2026)","author":"Big Bird, Hong Jung Hoon","artist":"JI Chang-geun","genres":["Action","Drama","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"1cc3c93a-4ca0-41c9-805c-537368a2b743","number":"30","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"id":"c79cc022-67aa-4eeb-b714-7b9bf43244c0","number":"29","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-04-23","images":[]},{"id":"e406562d-5589-4d89-ab3f-3f348d1ea7bc","number":"28","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-04-17","images":[]},{"id":"29d01af1-e91d-4a53-bd0c-34b0f85039f5","number":"27","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-04-03","images":[]},{"id":"20761b22-60b9-4eb6-a100-0c99505c05ac","number":"26","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-03-27","images":[]},{"id":"d2af9f23-2b12-4f23-b2d7-e3d5b85868a8","number":"25","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-03-20","images":[]},{"id":"b3ec40a3-8375-4741-b475-375ef7775351","number":"24","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-03-14","images":[]},{"id":"0d1677e2-aa57-4761-9dd3-7bb151d97474","number":"23","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-02-27","images":[]},{"id":"c3b477bd-4662-443a-b194-f024f24c4311","number":"22","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-02-20","images":[]},{"id":"d01fb842-f931-40ff-9e30-da5a79602a69","number":"21","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"id":"80110ad8-f651-47a1-b2bc-d8cbfe6d1615","number":"20","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-02-15","i